-#
-#  The switch that shows a selectable table's chosen rows alone: it names the
-#  form the table's selection posts to (data-form), through which the shared
-#  selection JS (shared/wsjrdp/_table_selection_js) finds the table's scope,
-#  hides the rows whose checkbox is off and remembers the switch per table.
-#
-#  Locals: form_id
- form_id = local_assigns.fetch(:form_id)
.form-check.form-switch.mb-0.small
  %input.form-check-input.bk-only-selected-toggle{type: "checkbox", role: "switch",
    id: "#{form_id}-only-selected", data: {form: form_id}}
  %label.form-check-label{for: "#{form_id}-only-selected"} nur Gewählte anzeigen
